Subject: [PATCH] Sandbox: personal data toggles for isolated apps (Titan 2)

Contacts, call log, SMS, calendar, location and photos/files switches
under the isolated app's options; off (default) hides the data from it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
